  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Our Editor\r\n\r\nThis is Web Lab - a tool we'll be using to make websites. It has an AI Assistant built in, named AI Tutor. You can chat with AI tutor in the text box underneath this window.\r\n\r\nThis level is all about exploring Web Lab and having your first interaction with AI Tutor, referencing the otter webpage that's already been built for you.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n- Explore Web Lab. Hover over icons to see what they do. See if you can make the webpage preview full-screen or find the Settings menu.\r\n- Ask AI Tutor to make a change to this webpage. You could ask it to add a new section, or change how the webpage looks, or even generate something entirely new!\r\n\r\n_Hint: You can press the \"Hide Instructions\" button underneath here to hide these instructions and just view AI Tutor_\r\n\r\nOnce AI Tutor has made at least one change to this site, press Continue to go to the next level.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "true",
